      "key": "SFCC-81",
      "summary": "PLP UI - Page Template & Hero (Category Hierarchy)",
      "description": "As a \nShopper, \n\n\nI want\n the product listing page to reflect the category I'm browsing,\n\n\nso that\n I understand where I am in the site and can easily move between related categories.\nReference image (Figma is leading):\nThe hero image slot and subcategory navigation behave differently depending on the category level. Based on the confirmed design hierarchy:\nLevel\nExamples\nHero\nSubcategory links\n1 — Collections\nSwim & Resort, RTW, New, Clothing, Accessories\nTall hero\nYes\n2 — Category\nDresses, Tailoring, Bags, Shoes, Swimsuits, Knitwear\nMedium hero\nYes\n3 — Sub-category\nMini Dresses, Boots\nNone\nNo",
