      "id": "18202",
      "key": "SFCC-119",
      "summary": "Recommendations – Complete the Look UI",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \n\n\nI want\n to see complementary product recommendations on a product page \n\n\nso that\n I can easily discover and add items that complete my outfit without having to search manually.\nThis story covers the PWA build of the Complete the Look / Shop the Edit component on the PDP. Per design sign-off, the component renders as a hero image on the left with 2 product tiles on the right. When it is Shop the Edit, a Shop the Edit link is displayed, taking the shopper through to a PLP filtered to show all items from that edit.\nThe component label renders as either Complete the Look or Shop the Edit, configured by the merchandiser in Business Manager. The products displayed are manually curated by the merchandiser and tied to the hero image - this is not an algorithmic or personalised recommendation surface.\nThis surface does not appear on Cart or Mini-Bag - those surfaces show YMAL only (covered in SFCC-118). Integration testing is dependent on Squad A delivering the PDP (SFCC-5).",
